here are in this world that I do not want,” and that’s a form of freedom, so not wanting something is as good as having it.", "fhl": [20, 31], "zh": "快乐是个非常复杂的话题，不过我一直很喜欢苏格拉底的那个故事：他走进集市，人们给他看各种奢侈品和华服美饰，他说：“这世上竟有这么多我不想要的东西啊。”那就是一种自由，所以不想要一样东西，和拥有它一样好。", "zb": [6, 9], "sg": [[0, 75, "audio/t01o/s05.mp3", 0, 5.63], [76, 94, "audio/t01o/s06.mp3", 0, 1.15], [95, 160, "audio/t01o/s06.mp3", 1.15, 4.15], [161, 208, "audio/t01o/s06.mp3", 4.15, 6.41], [209, 235, "audio/t01o/s06.mp3", 6.41, 7.71], [236, 265, "audio/t01o/s07.mp3", 0.0, 1.59], [266, 315, "audio/t01o/s07.mp3", 1.59, 5.03]]}, "tt": {"w": 225.56, "ex": [["Complicated", 228.46], ["means", 228.96], ["it", 229.22], ["has", 229.64], ["many", 229.8], ["parts", 230.0], ["and", 230.48], ["it", 231.18], ["is", 231.33], ["hard", 231.49], ["to", 231.64], ["understand", 231.98], ["or", 232.5], ["explain.", 232.96], ["It", 234.32], ["is", 234.38], ["the", 234.5], ["opposite", 234.64], ["of", 235.08], ["simple.", 235.38]], "exs": [[["Volume", 238.87], ["lashes", 239.28], ["look", 239.69], ["simple,", 239.98], ["but", 240.44], ["the", 240.49], ["technique", 240.54], ["is", 240.59], ["complicated.", 240.81]], [["It's", 252.31], ["complicated.", 252.59], ["I'll", 253.32], ["explain", 253.61], ["it", 253.66], ["later.", 253.71]]], "z": [243.19, 255.37], "r": [247.07, 258.14], "o": 261.8, "rx": [[247.07, 247.48, 247.89, 248.18, 248.64, 248.69, 248.74, 248.79, 249.01], [258.14, 258.42, 259.15, 259.44, 259.49, 259.54]]}}, {"n": 7, "w": "marketplace", "pos": "n.", "zh": "集市；市场", "ex": "A marketplace is an open place in a town where people buy and sell things. Today it can also mean any place to buy and sell, like an online marketplace.", "exs": ["We walked around the marketplace and tried some street food.", "She sells her lash products on an online marketplace."], "t": 281.86, "src": {"t": "where he goes into the marketplace and they show him all these luxuries and fineries and he says, “How many things there are in this world that I 