 of freedom, so not wanting something is as good as having it.", "fhl": [247, 256], "zh": "快乐是个非常复杂的话题，不过我一直很喜欢苏格拉底的那个故事：他走进集市，人们给他看各种奢侈品和华服美饰，他说：“这世上竟有这么多我不想要的东西啊。”那就是一种自由，所以不想要一样东西，和拥有它一样好。", "zb": [77, 79], "sg": [[0, 75, "audio/t01o/s05.mp3", 0, 5.63], [76, 94, "audio/t01o/s06.mp3", 0, 1.15], [95, 160, "audio/t01o/s06.mp3", 1.15, 4.15], [161, 208, "audio/t01o/s06.mp3", 4.15, 6.41], [209, 235, "audio/t01o/s06.mp3", 6.41, 7.71], [236, 265, "audio/t01o/s07.mp3", 0.0, 1.59], [266, 315, "audio/t01o/s07.mp3", 1.59, 5.03]]}, "tt": {"w": 451.02, "ex": [["A", 453.9], ["form", 454.03], ["of", 454.35], ["means", 454.54], ["one", 454.92], ["kind", 455.18], ["or", 455.5], ["one", 455.69], ["type", 455.95], ["of", 456.27], ["something.", 456.46], ["When", 457.16], ["Naval", 457.48], ["says", 457.86], ["a", 458.18], ["form", 458.31], ["of", 458.63], ["freedom,", 458.82], ["he", 459.4], ["means", 459.59], ["one", 459.97], ["way", 460.23], ["to", 460.49], ["be", 460.68], ["free.", 460.87]], "exs": [[["Walking", 464.5], ["is", 464.95], ["a", 465.12], ["great", 465.24], ["form", 465.58], ["of", 465.86], ["exercise.", 466.03]], [["Taking", 474.27], ["care", 474.68], ["of", 474.97], ["yourself", 475.14], ["is", 475.66], ["a", 475.84], ["form", 475.95], ["of", 476.24], ["self-respect.", 476.42]]], "z": [467.37, 477.98], "r": [470.48, 480.7], "o": 485.01, "rx": [[470.48, 470.93, 471.1, 471.22, 471.56, 471.84, 472.01], [480.7, 481.11, 481.4, 481.57, 482.09, 482.27, 482.38, 482.67, 482.85]]}}, {"n": 11, "w": "as good as", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "和……一样好；几乎等于", "ex": "As good as means just as good, or almost the same as. Not wanting something is as good as having it means it gives you the same feeling.", "exs": ["After the repair, my phone is as good as new.", "The job is as good as done. I just need to send it."], "t": 505.07, "src": {"t": "and that’s a form of freedom, so not wanting something is as good as having it.", "a": "audio/t01/s07.mp3", "hl": [58, 68], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "aud