7.79, 537.96, 538.13, 538.42, 538.6, 538.94, 539.06, 539.35, 539.64, 539.81, 540.1]]}}, {"n": 12, "w": "conquer", "pos": "v.", "zh": "征服；克服", "ex": "To conquer means to win and take control of a place or people, usually in a war. It can also mean to beat a problem or a fear.", "exs": ["Alexander conquered many countries.", "She finally conquered her fear of speaking English."], "t": 561.74, "src": {"t": "In the old story with Alexander and Diogenes, Alexander goes out and conquers the world and he meets Diogenes who’s living in a barrel.", "a": "audio/t01/s08.mp3", "hl": [69, 77], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t01o/s08.mp3", "oab": [3.06, 5.0], "oas": ["audio/t01o/s08.mp3"], "zh": "在亚历山大和第欧根尼的老故事里，亚历山大出去征服了世界，然后遇到了住在一个木桶里的第欧根尼。", "zb": [22, 24], "sg": [[0, 45, "audio/t01o/s08.mp3", 0.0, 1.78], [46, 109, "audio/t01o/s08.mp3", 3.06, 5.0], [110, 135, "audio/t01o/s08.mp3", 5.34, 6.58]]}, "tt": {"w": 561.74, "ex": [["To", 564.37], ["conquer", 564.56], ["means", 565.08], ["to", 565.47], ["win", 565.66], ["and", 565.92], ["take", 566.18], ["control", 566.51], ["of", 567.03], ["a", 567.22], ["place", 567.35], ["or", 567.74], ["people,", 567.93], ["usually", 568.45], ["in", 568.97], ["a", 569.17], ["war.", 569.3], ["It", 569.62], ["can", 569.82], ["also", 570.08], ["mean", 570.4], ["to", 570.72], ["beat", 570.92], ["a", 571.24], ["problem", 571.37], ["or", 571.89], ["a", 572.09], ["fear.", 572.22]], "exs": [[["Alexander", 575.85], ["conquered", 576.38], ["many", 576.9], ["countries.", 577.16]], [["She", 584.98], ["finally", 585.16], ["conquered", 585.53], ["her", 585.99], ["fear", 586.17], ["of", 586.4], ["speaking", 586.54], ["English.", 586.95]]], "z": [578.44, 588.05], "r": [581.4, 591.14], "o": 594.81, "rx": [[581.4, 581.93, 582.45, 582.71], [591.14, 591.32, 591.69, 592.15, 592.33, 592.56, 592.7, 593.11]]}}, {"n": 13, "w": "block", "pos": "v.", "zh": "挡住；阻挡", "ex": "To block means to stand or be in the way, so something cannot get through. If you block my sun, your body stops the sunlight from reaching me.", "exs": ["Your head is blocking the light. Can you move a little?", "A big truck was blocking the road."], "t": 602.74, "src": {"t": "Diogenes says “Get out of the way, you’re blocking my sun,”", "a": "audio/t01/s09.mp3", "hl": [42, 50], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t01o/s09.mp3", "oab": [0.0, 3.37], "oas": ["audio/t01o/s09.mp3", "audio/t01o/s10.mp3"], "ft": "Diogenes says “Get out of the way, you’re blocking my sun,” and Alexander says “Oh how I wish I could be like Diogenes in the next life,” and Diogenes says, “I don’t wish to be Alexander.”", "fhl": [42, 50], "zh": "第欧根尼说：“让开，你挡住我的阳光了。”亚历山大说：“唉，我多希望下辈子能像第欧根尼一样。”第欧根尼却说：“我可不想当亚历山大。”", "zb": [11, 13], "sg": [[0, 59, "audio/t01o/s09.mp3", 0.0, 3.37], [60, 78, "audio/t01o/s10.mp3", 0.0, 1.4], [79, 95, "audio/t01o/s10.mp3", 1.44, 2.36], [96, 156, "audio/t01o/s10.mp3", 2.76, 5.58], [157, 188, "audio/t01o/s10.mp3", 9.52, 11.28]]}, "tt": {"w": 602.74, "ex": [["To", 605.44], ["block", 605.61], ["means", 605.97], ["to", 606.33], ["stand", 606.51], ["or", 606.87], ["be", 607.04], ["in", 607.22], ["the", 607.4], ["way,", 607.64], ["so", 607.94], ["something", 608.12], ["cannot", 608.71], ["get", 609.13], ["through.", 609.37], ["If", 609.9], ["you", 610.08], ["block", 610.32], ["my", 610.68], ["sun,", 613.24], ["your", 613.25], ["body", 613.25], ["stops", 613.26], ["the", 613.26], ["sunlight", 613.27], ["from", 613.27], ["reaching", 613.47], ["me.", 613.79]], "exs": [[["Your", 617.13], ["head", 617.25], ["is", 617.51], ["blocking", 617.67], ["the", 617.97], ["light.", 618.33], ["Can", 619.13], ["you", 619.19], ["move", 619.31], ["a", 619.53], ["little?", 619.67]], [["A", 627.63], ["big", 627.68], ["truck", 627.82], ["was", 628.1], ["blocking", 628.42], ["the", 628.88], ["road.", 629.06]]], "z": [620.55, 630.0], "r": [623.21, 632.47], "o": 635.44, "rx": [[623.21, 623.33, 623.59, 623.75, 624.05, 624.41, 625.21, 625.27, 625.39, 625.61, 625.75], [632.47, 632.52, 632.66, 632.94, 633.26, 633.72, 633.9]]}}, {"n": 14, "w": "satisfy", "pos": "v.", "zh": "满足（需要、欲望）", "ex": "To satisfy means to give someone what they need or want, so they feel it is enough. You satisfy your hunger when you eat.", "exs": ["Nothing seems to satisfy him. He always wants more.", "This salad won't satisfy me. I need real food."], "t": 651.98, "src": {"t": "So two paths to happiness: one path is success, you get what you want, you satisfy your material needs,", "a": "audio/t01/s11.mp3", "hl": [75, 82], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t01o/s11.mp3", "oab": [5.58, 6.86], "oas": ["audio/t01o/s11.mp3", "audio/t01o/s12.mp3"], "ft": "So two paths to happiness: one path is success, you get what you want, you satisfy your material needs, or like Diogenes, where you just don’t want it in the first place.", "fhl": [75, 82], "zh": "所以通往快乐有两条路：一条是成功，你得到想要的东西，满足你的物质需求，另一条就像第欧根尼那样，你从一开始就不想要它。", "zb": [26, 28], "sg": [[0, 26, "audio/t01o/s11.mp3", 0.2, 2.36], [27, 47, "audio/t01o/s11.mp3", 2.94, 4.46], [48, 70, "audio/t01o/s11.mp3", 4.68, 5.44], [71, 103, "audio/t01o/s11.mp3", 5.58, 6.86], [104, 142, "audio/t01o/s12.mp3", 0.0, 1.44], [143, 170, "audio/t01o/s12.mp3", 1.44, 2.8]]}, "tt": {"w": 651.98, "ex": [["To", 655.17], ["satisfy", 655.34], ["means", 655.4], ["to", 655.88], ["give", 656.16], ["someone", 656.32], ["what", 656.64], ["they", 656.94], ["need", 657.12], ["or", 657.42], ["want,", 657.72], ["so", 658.38], ["they", 658.7], ["feel", 658.84], ["it", 659.08], ["is", 659.34], ["enough.", 659.46], ["You", 660.48], ["satisfy", 660.54], ["your", 660.84], ["hunger", 661.38], ["when", 661.7], ["you", 661.96], ["eat.", 662.1]], "exs": [[["Nothing", 665.53], ["seems", 665.66], ["to", 665.92], ["satisfy", 666.2], ["him.", 666.52], ["He", 667.46], ["always", 667.62], ["wants", 667.8], ["more.", 668.28]], [["This", 678.18], ["salad", 678.23], ["won't", 678.48], ["satisfy", 678.86], ["me.", 679.16], ["I", 680.18], ["need", 680.24], ["real", 680.44], ["food.", 680.7]]], "z": [669.36, 682.0], "r": [673.34, 685.58], "o": 690.0, "rx": [[673.34, 673.47, 673.73, 674.01, 674.33, 675.27, 675.43, 675.61, 676.09], [685.58, 685.63, 685.88, 686.26, 686.56, 687.58, 687.64, 687.84, 688.1]]}}, {"n": 15, "w": "material needs", "pos": "n. phrase", "zh": "物质需求", "ex": "Material needs are the things you need for your body and daily life, like food, a home, clothes and money. They are things, not feelings.", "exs": ["Once your material needs are met, money matters less.", "Work can meet your material needs, but not all your needs."], "t": 701.34, "src": {"t": "So two paths to happiness: one path is success, you get what you want, you satisfy your material needs,", "a": "audio/t01/s11.mp3", "hl": [88, 102], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t01o/s11.mp3", "oab": [5.58, 6.86], "oas": ["audio/t01o/s11.mp3", "audio/t01o/s12.mp3"], "ft": "So two paths to happiness: one path is success, you get what you want, you satisfy your material needs, or like Diogenes, where you just don’t want it in the first place.", "fhl": [88, 102], "zh": "所以通往快乐有两条路：一条是成功，你得到想要的东西，满足你的物质需求，另一条就像第欧根尼那样，你从一开始就不想要它。", "zb": [30, 34], "sg": [[0, 26, "audio/t01o/s11.mp3", 0.2, 2.36], [27, 47, "audio/t01o/s11.mp3", 2.94, 4.46], [48, 70, "audio/t01o/s11.mp3", 4.68, 5.44], [71, 103, "audio/t01o/s11.mp3", 5.58, 6.86], [104, 142, "audio/t01o/s12.mp3", 0.0, 1.44], [143, 170, "audio/t01o/s12.mp3", 1.44, 2.8]]}, "tt": {"w": 701.34, "ex": [["Material", 704.5], ["needs", 704.55], ["are", 704.91], ["the", 705.25], ["things", 705.37], ["you", 705.81], ["need", 705.81], ["for", 706.01], ["your", 706.21], ["body", 706.35], ["and", 706.75], ["daily", 706.95], ["life,", 707.17], ["like", 708.13], ["food,", 708.25], ["a", 709.17], ["home,", 709.25], ["clothes", 710.23], ["and", 710.53], ["money.", 710.65], ["They", 711.51], ["are", 711.69], ["things,", 711.81], ["not", 712.15], ["feelings.", 712.55]], "exs": [[["Once", 716.36], ["your", 716.37], ["material", 716.59], ["needs", 717.03], ["are", 717.29], ["met,", 717.59], ["money", 718.27], ["ma